{"title":"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 36","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_36\">Problem 36</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 36\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A cylindrical oil tank, lying horizontally, has an interior length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> feet and an interior diameter of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> feet. \nIf the rectangular surface of the oil has an area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> square feet, the depth of the oil is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/f/abfe1fc14eb649c32d465478a88e1daff4e8161e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\sqrt{5}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2\\sqrt{5}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 3-\\sqrt{5}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 3+\\sqrt{5}\\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{either }3-\\sqrt{5}\\text{ or }3+\\sqrt{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"46\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_.28takes_advantage_of_answer_choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_(takes_advantage_of_answer_choices)\">Solution (takes advantage of answer choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution (takes advantage of answer choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In order to complete the rectangle area of the oil tank, the chord on the circle must have a length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Since it's not the diameter <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, there are two possible outcomes. The only choice that reflects this is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bfc0829f3f29bbf35d0a861644e00cfef0f50ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"39\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To return back to the problem set, click <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems\">right here</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017161602\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.022 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 49/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 335/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1393/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.038      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n100.00%    5.038      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:19506:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017161602 and revision id 131503. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}